							<div class="step-card" data-step="1"><strong>Step 2</strong><p>Subtract <span class="mathjax" data-tex="3"></span> from both sides: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="3x = 12"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="2"><strong>Step 3</strong><p>Divide both sides by <span class="mathjax" data-tex="3"></span>: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="x = 4"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="3"><strong>Check</strong><p>Substitute <span class="mathjax" data-tex="x = 4"></span>: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="4(4)+3 = 4+15"></span>, so <span class="mathjax" data-tex="19 = 19"></span>.</p></div>
