						<h2>Board challenge</h2>
						<p class="slide-lede tight-lede">Give each team one equation. They must show: remove <span class="mathjax" data-tex="x"></span> terms, cancel the constant, split, and check.</p>
						<div class="challenge-grid">
							<div class="challenge-card"><strong>Team A</strong><span class="mathjax" data-tex="3x + 7 = x + 17"></span><button type="button" class="primary-button" data-toggle-target="board-a">Reveal</button><p id="board-a" class="hidden-answer"><span class="mathjax" data-tex="x = 5"></span></p></div>
							<div class="challenge-card"><strong>Team B</strong><span class="mathjax" data-tex="5x - 6 = 2x + 9"></span><button type="button" class="primary-button" data-toggle-target="board-b">Reveal</button><p id="board-b" class="hidden-answer"><span class="mathjax" data-tex="x = 5"></span></p></div>
